    {
      "id": 603,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "size": [
        520,
        760
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 7,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Montagio · Motion transfer\n\nThe character of a photo moves like a reference video of up to 5 s: Wan2.2-Animate-2, distilled, 10 steps, the reference video taken raw (no pose extractor), its sound left out.\n\n**Tip:** Frame the photo like the video: a full-body character for a full-body dance.\n\n**Models**, under `ComfyUI/models/`:\n- `diffusion_models/wan_animate_2_distill_int8_convrot.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from Wan-AI/Wan2.2-Animate-2-14B)\n- `text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from google/umt5-xxl)\n- `clip_vision/clip_vision_h.safetensors` (MIT, from laion/CLIP-ViT-H-14-laion2B-s32B-b79K)\n- `vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from Wan-AI/Wan2.1-I2V-14B-480P)\n\nCore nodes only (marked experimental in ComfyUI v0.41.0). 391 to 415 s on an NVIDIA L4 (24 GB), peak 20.1 to 22.2 GB.\n\nOpen weights only: every file is Apache-2.0 or MIT, pinned by sha256 in Montagio's `registry/models.lock.yaml`."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Montagio · Motion transfer\n\nThe character of a photo moves like a reference video of up to 5 s: Wan2.2-Animate-2, distilled, 10 steps, the reference video taken raw (no pose extractor), its sound left out.\n\n**Tip:** Frame the photo like the video: a full-body character for a full-body dance.\n\n**Models**, under `ComfyUI/models/`:\n- `diffusion_models/wan_animate_2_distill_int8_convrot.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from Wan-AI/Wan2.2-Animate-2-14B)\n- `text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from google/umt5-xxl)\n- `clip_vision/clip_vision_h.safetensors` (MIT, from laion/CLIP-ViT-H-14-laion2B-s32B-b79K)\n- `vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from Wan-AI/Wan2.1-I2V-14B-480P)\n\nCore nodes only (marked experimental in ComfyUI v0.41.0). 391 to 415 s on an NVIDIA L4 (24 GB), peak 20.1 to 22.2 GB.\n\nOpen weights only: every file is Apache-2.0 or MIT, pinned by sha256 in Montagio's `registry/models.lock.yaml`."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
